	(text "RGB (amendment 5): powered from LED_PWR (killable 3.3V rail), not +3V3_MCU -- SK6805-EC15 VDD floor is 3.7V (below-datasheet-floor 3.3V op is sourcing.md-flagged standard practice).\nVIH arithmetic: VIH ~= 0.7*VDD_actual = 0.7*3.3V = 2.31V; RGB_DI driven from a 3.3V RP2040 GPIO satisfies VIH with 0.99V margin (43%)."
		(at 3 226 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
